-- Load Ledlenser's product sheet into ledlenser.brand_catalog (2026-11-04). Needs 20261104170000_ledlenser_schema.sql.
--
-- Source: "Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx" (Plytix export from the brand), sheet
-- "Plytix Master Product Import", 97 rows. Generated by script; the wholesale price ("Wholesale Customer
-- Price USD") and cost ("MD Wholesale Cost USD") columns are left out on purpose, because Ledlenser views are
-- readable with the public key. Packaging, carton, tariff, compatibility and compliance columns are not stored.
--
-- 84 rows are Status = Complete. 13 rows have only SKU, label, UPC and MAP price (older "Core" models and
-- MH8 / MH10); sheet_status is NULL for those.
-- The sheet gives the same UPC to more than one product in 5 places (for example 847706104409 is on the
-- HF7R Signature, H7R Signature and P7R Signature). They are loaded as the sheet has them; Keepa's model
-- number decides which product each UPC really belongs to when listings are matched.
--
-- Additive only. Undo: DELETE FROM ledlenser.brand_catalog WHERE source_file = 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx';

