  ('503317', 'Ledlenser HF4R Black Headlamp', '847706104164', '847706104164', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF4R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Camping, DIY projects or working around the house and garden: With the compact HF4R headlamp, you are ready for everyday life and small adventures.', 'Whether you are working on a DIY project in your garage or roaming outdoors on a camping trip: The HF4R headlamp helps reveal adventures big and small with spot for long-range and flood light for close-up illumination. To help you preserve your night vision, you can also use the additional red front light. The HF4R operates with both rechargeable and disposable batteries—so you never run out of light. To match your headlamp to your style, you can choose from three different colorways. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF4R contains recycled materials13.', 'Compact headlamp with spot for long-range and flood light for close-up illumination | Additional red front light to preserve night vision | Dual Power Source: Operates with rechargeable (included) and disposable batteries, charging via USB-C | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty* | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 49.95, 650, 20, 'IP67', 92, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 1350mAh (3.85V, 5.2Wh) / 3x AAA Alkaline', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 1350mAh', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=83CHh4gRVNY', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-M6-hUBMsWfdsTQLF3y84TEb9p4fl8LF/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,headlamp with red light,head torch,rechargeable headtorch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
