  ('503309', 'Ledlenser HF4R RGB Headlamp (Camouflage)', '847706104195', '847706104195', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF4R RGB', 'RGB Edition', 'Camouflage', 'Planning your next fishing or hunting trip? Don’t forget to bring your HF4R RGB headlamp—compact, yet ready for all your adventures after dark.', 'Hunting, fishing or boating: With the HF4R RGB headlamp, you are ready to embark on your next adventure. Free yourself from the limits of daylight and reveal hidden treasures such as a ripple on the tranquil lake or broken twigs deep in the forest with spot for long-range and flood light for close-up illumination. You can also use red light to help you preserve your night vision, green light for wildlife observation and blue light for tracking wounded game. The HF4R RGB operates with both rechargeable and disposable batteries; so you never run out of light. To match your headlamp to your hunting or fishing gear, the headband comes in a camouflage design. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF4R RGB contains recycled materials13.', 'Compact headlamp with spot for long-range and flood light for close-up illumination | Additional red, green and blue front light | Dual Power Source: Operates with rechargeable (included) and disposable batteries, charging via USB-C | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty* | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 59.95, 650, 20, 'IP67', 92, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 1350mAh (3.85V, 5.2Wh) / 3x AAA Alkaline', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 1350mAh', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nSvatU6mzGE', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nE2HPSPWs6GR64SBOjtzDXxoK52ucg6A/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,RGB headlamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,camouflage headlamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503318', 'Ledlenser HF4R Pro Headlamp', '847706104201', '847706104201', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF4R Pro', 'Pro Edition', 'Black', 'If you work in confined spaces and often need additional light, the HF4R Pro headlamp is just right for you: compact, yet up to any professional challenge.', 'Reveal what lies ahead: Cramped engine rooms, poorly lit painting jobs or narrow engine compartments have nothing on your HF4R Pro headlamp. The compact model offers spot for long-range and flood light for close-up illumination as well as additional red light to maintain your night vision. Ideal when connecting your customer’s new sink or during work in an industrial plant and easy to mount on your helmet. The HF4R Pro operates with both rechargeable and disposable batteries; so you never run out of light. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF4R Pro contains recycled materials13.', 'Compact headlamp with spot for long-range and flood light for close-up illumination as well as red front light | Dual Power Source: Operates with rechargeable (included) and disposable batteries, charging via USB-C | Attaches to helmet via included helmet mount and adapter or rubberized headband | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty* | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 59.95, 650, 20, 'IP67', 92, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 1350mAh (3.85V, 5.2Wh) / 3x AAA Alkaline', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 1350mAh, Helmet mount', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GXUZf8-_I2A', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cRj6Cj88uDRphi9QYZn2F8VE6L3Sgb-N/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable headlamp,work headlamp,headtorch,rechargeable head torch,helmet headlamp,professional headtorch,work headlamp,work head torch,headlamp with red light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503319', 'Ledlenser HF6R Headlamp', '847706104218', '847706104218', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF6R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Whether you are roaming the great outdoors or tackling a DIY project at home: With the HF6R headlamp, you are ready to reveal the world.', 'Whether you are an outdoor enthusiast about to embark on your next hiking, trekking or backpacking adventure or are an ambitious DIYer creatively envisioning upcoming projects—the HF6R headlamp lets you see the world in a new light. The powerful headlamp comes with a robust aluminium housing, offers spot, mid and flood light as well as an additional red front light to help you preserve your night vision. You can even use the HF6R hands-free thanks to the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing. This way, you can focus entirely on the hiking path ahead, on building your tent after dark or constructing your new built-in storage—without having to worry about adjusting the light. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF6R contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with spot, mid and flood light as well as red front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Charging via USB-C | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty* | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 79.95, 900, 20, 'IP67', 130, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TnzQQJuiqoA', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qJ4p10O0Fw9dIHmlyZzcrCrz8b92qQKw/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,headlamp with red light,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,autofocus headlamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503344', 'Ledlenser HF6R Pro Headlamp', '847706104232', '847706104232', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF6R Pro', 'Pro Edition', 'Black', 'No matter what job, the HF6R Pro has your back: from car repairs to maintenance work or construction jobs, this headlamp reveals even the slightest details.', 'Light is instrumental in doing your job right: Be it lying on your back to inspect a vehicle underbody or repairing a blown fuse with flood light—or when illuminating a far-away construction site area with spotlight. The HF6R Pro also offers an additional red front light to help you preserve your night vision and comes with a robust aluminium housing. You can even use the headlamp hands-free thanks to the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing. This way, you can focus entirely on the job at hand—without having to worry about adjusting the light. Simply mount it on your helmet via the enclosed accessories or the rubberized headband and get to work. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF6R Pro contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with spot, mid and flood light as well as red front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Attaches to helmet via included helmet mount and adapter or rubberized headband | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty*, charging via USB-C | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 94.95, 900, 20, 'IP67', 130, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh, Helmet mount', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQIvSYA8yn4', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JQdNnm_n2rMd5js8vnr4VMPGy0K6GfDk/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,headlamp with red light,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,autofocus headlamp,helmet headlamp,professional headtorch,work headlamp,work head torch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503345', 'Ledlenser HF6R RGB Headlamp (Camouflage)', '847706104225', '847706104225', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF6R RGB', 'RGB Edition', 'Camouflage', 'Ideal if you like to spend your time in the forest or at the lake: the HF6R RGB headlamp, your hunting or fishing companion.', 'If you’re into hunting or fishing, the HF6R RGB headlamp is your trusted companion. Its powerful spot, mid and flood light reveals both small details and the bigger picture; from a ripple on the tranquil lake to broken twigs on your way to a sheltered clearing deep in the forest. You can also use red light to help you preserve your night vision, green light for wildlife observation and blue light for tracking prey—or rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your HF6R RGB. This way, you can focus on climbing a raised blind, attaching bait to the hook or observing wildlife. To match your headlamp to your hunting or fishing gear, the headband comes in a camouflage design, while the robust housing is made from aluminium. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF6R RGB contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with spot, mid and flood light as well as red, green and blue front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Charging via USB-C | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty* | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 84.95, 900, 20, 'IP67', 130, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y9z3LrE9Ins', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hPXbW-2Q0D2kzMzoStSyuIclqBeEkdcg/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,RGB headlamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,autofocus headlamp,camouflage headlamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503349', 'Ledlenser HF7R Black Headlamp', '847706104249', '847706104249', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF7R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Built for demanding conditions: The HF7R headlamp lights your way during rescue missions, during extended outdoor activities or when going out on the boat.', 'Built for demanding conditions: If your work depends on reliable light—like that of an emergency physician—or you are an outdoor and sports enthusiast who regularly ventures out after dark, the HF7R headlamp is just for you. It comes with a robust aluminium housing, and its powerful spot, mid or flood light provides reliable light during emergency operations—or reveals bumps on the ski slope or obstacles when mountaineering. You can also use red light to help you preserve your night vision or rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your HF7R. This way, you can focus on your outdoor adventure or any professional challenge at hand. If you prefer manual control, the enhanced Digital Advanced Focus System is the way to go. By turning the digital focus ring, you can digitally switch from flood to spot to suit any range or task. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF7R contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with spot, mid and flood light as well as red front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Intuitive focusing (Digital Advanced Focus System) via digital focus ring | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty*, charging via USB-C | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 124.95, 1200, 20, 'IP67', 134, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HSakXq9GBpA', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wslob4prTi51Lygjrq0NF9k3VKCKfhYL/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,headlamp with red light,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,autofocus headlamp,digital headlamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503320', 'Ledlenser HF7R Pro Headlamp', '847706104263', '847706104263', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF7R Pro', 'Pro Edition', 'Black', 'You do not reveal hidden details or expansive areas just for fun—it’s your job. And to do it properly, light is of the essence: Ledlenser HF7R Pro.', 'You do not reveal hidden details or expansive areas just for fun—it’s your job. And to do it properly, light is of the essence. With the HF7R Pro headlamp, you are ready to tackle the next challenge—and discover small miracles where you least expect them. Be it finding a long-lost screw while finishing a maintenance job or discovering the well-kept secrets of a run-down estate while taking care of electrical work or plumbing; the powerful spot, mid or flood light offers the best light for any task at hand. Its robust housing is made from aluminium. You can also use red light to help you preserve your night vision—or rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your HF7R Pro. This way, you can focus completely on your job. If you prefer manual control, the enhanced Digital Advanced Focus System is the way to go. By turning the digital focus ring, you can digitally switch from flood to spot to suit any range or task. Simply mount the HF7R Pro on your helmet via the enclosed accessories or the rubberized headband and get to work. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF7R Pro contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with spot, mid and flood light as well as red front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Intuitive focusing (Digital Advanced Focus System) via digital focus ring | Attaches to helmet via included helmet mount and adapter or rubberized headband | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty*, charging via USB-C', 149.95, 1200, 20, 'IP67', 134, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh, Helmet mount', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MGzO93fL-FE', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NLLnj5nFR5cM84Y8E-5qFFXCCCArmZXl/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,headlamp with red light,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,autofocus headlamp,helmet headlamp,professional headtorch,work headlamp,work head torch,digital headlamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503313', 'Ledlenser HF7R RGB Headlamp (Camouflage)', '847706104256', '847706104256', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF7R RGB', 'RGB Edition', 'Camouflage', 'Ideal for hunting and fishing enthusiasts who spend most of their time outdoors and love to explore: the powerful HF7R RGB headlamp.', 'Hunting in the forest or patiently waiting for the next big catch can get lonely. With the HF7R RGB headlamp, you will not miss the small wonders of nature that surround you: from a flock of curious ducklings to a magnificent tree on the meadow or unusual tracks on the forest floor. The powerful spot, mid or flood light reveals what you might otherwise miss. You can also use red light to help you preserve your night vision, green light for wildlife observation and blue light for tracking prey—or rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your HF7R RGB. This way, you can focus on quietly stalking the woods, preparing your fishing rod or monitoring the woods from a raised blind. If you prefer manual control, the enhanced Digital Advanced Focus System is the way to go. By turning the digital focus ring, you can digitally switch from flood to spot to suit any range or task. To match your headlamp to your hunting or fishing gear, the headband comes in a camouflage design while the robust housing is made from aluminium. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF7R RGB contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with spot, mid and flood light as well as red, green and blue front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Intuitive focusing (Digital Advanced Focus System) via digital focus ring | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty*, charging via USB-C | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 139.95, 1200, 20, 'IP67', 134, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PC8Bi5wZRaM', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ID9EXA6dt9rNpD_sNPbo5BlhQtotOwCJ/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,RGB headlamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,autofocus headlamp,digital headlamp,camouflage headlamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503347', 'Ledlenser HF6R Signature Headlamp', '847706104386', '847706104386', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF6R Signature', 'Signature Edition', 'Grey Metallic', 'Camping, hiking, trekking or backpacking: There’s no better way to do it than with the HF6R Signature headlamp—exclusive design meets high performance.', 'Exclusive design meets high performance: The HF6R Signature headlamp enables you to reveal the world, one step up a narrow path or along a winding road at a time. Its powerful spot, mid and flood light illuminates distant summits, a root you might stumble across or a rare bird close to your campsite. You can also use red light to help you preserve your night vision, green light for wildlife observation and blue light to make liquids visible—or rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your HF6R Signature. This way, you can focus on setting up camp or hiking the remaining distance after dark. To match your headlamp to your style, the HF6R Signature comes with a grey metallic aluminium housing as well as a reflective headband for added visibility. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF6R Signature contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with up to 1000 lm (boost), spot, mid and flood light as well as red, green and blue front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Exclusive design: Reflective headband and grey metallic aluminium housing | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty*, charging via USB-C | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 99.95, 1000, 20, 'IP67', 130, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh, Pouch H-series 2026', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hhdw1kCNjSg', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/12bNgTJVByw2CC383o4nD90gUbcO-L0eb/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,signature', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503219', 'Ledlenser HF7R Signature Headlamp', '847706104409', '847706104409', 'Headlamps > HF Series', 'Headlamps', 'HF Series', 'Complete', 'HF7R Signature', 'Signature Edition', 'Grey Metallic', 'Made to go to extremes: The stylish HF7R Signature accompanies on challenging outdoor adventures or when going out on the boat.', 'Made to go to extremes: Not many can match your enthusiasm about challenging outdoor adventures or boating—but the HF7R Signature is certainly trying. The powerful headlamp enables you to embark on adventures without worrying about natural light, guiding you down ski slopes or when climbing a mountain. You can also use red light to help you preserve your night vision, green light for wildlife observation and blue light to make liquids visible—or rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your HF7R Signature. This way, you can focus on any outdoor challenge you can think of. If you prefer manual control, the enhanced Digital Advanced Focus System is the way to go. By turning the digital focus ring, you can digitally switch from flood to spot to suit any range or task. To match your headlamp to your style, the HF7R Signature comes with a grey metallic aluminium housing as well as a reflective headband for added visibility. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your HF7R Signature contains recycled materials13.', 'Powerful headlamp with up to 1300 lm (boost), spot, mid and flood light as well as red, green and blue front light | Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use | Intuitive focusing (Digital Advanced Focus System) via digital focus ring | Exclusive design: Reflective headband and grey metallic aluminium housing | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty*, charging via USB-C', 154.95, 1300, 20, 'IP67', 134, true, 'Polymer Li-Ion Battery Pack 2400mAh (3.7V, 8.88Wh)', 'Charging cable (USB-C), Connect Adapter - HF 2026, Polymer Rechargeable Battery 2400mAh, Pouch H-series 2026', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAvrSW6luFg', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LI0kJJR7DGKK9tflYCywxuX202T8rcbU/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,signature', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503353', 'Ledlenser H7R Signature Headlamp', '847706104409', '847706104409', 'Headlamps > H Series', 'Headlamps', 'H Series', 'Complete', 'H7R Signature', 'Signature Edition', 'Grey Metallic', 'As ready for the next adventure or DIY as you are: The H7R Signature headlamp—powerful, stylish and intuitive to use.', 'As ready for the next adventure or DIY as you are: The H7R Signature. A headlamp so powerful and intuitive to use that you easily lose track of time and extend your adventures well past dark. It allows you to illuminate big areas and far-away spots alike—while revealing small wonders along the way. An otter swimming next to your boat, a ripple on the lake or the missing screw to finish your DIY project. The Advanced Focus System offers the ideal light for any range and task—simply use the focus ring for stepless focusing and the encoder for dimming. In spot mode, the beam range of your H7R Signature is up to 370 m. The powerful battery also operates while charging, so you never run out of light on your adventures—and is located at the back of your head for a balanced weight distribution. To match your headlamp to your style, the H7R Signature comes with a grey metallic housing as well as a reflective headband for added visibility. When not in use, you can safely store and transport your headlamp in the enclosed pouch. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your H7R Signature contains recycled materials13.', 'Stepless dimming and focusing (Advanced Focus System), up to 1400 lm (boost) and beam range of up to 370 m (spot) | Powerful battery: Charges via USB-C and operates while charging | Exclusive design: Reflective headband and grey metallic housing | Sustainable: Use of recycled materials13 and 7-year warranty* | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 154.95, 1400, 15, 'IP67', 252, true, '21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.6V, 4600mAh, 16.56Wh)', '1 set of rechargeable batteries (21700 Li-Ion), Charging cable (USB-C), Pouch H-series 2026', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d5IYFF-eziE', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FEIdHzQ7M9FYPKjQM6Poxnss5J5wjFNx/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,signature', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503225', 'Ledlenser H9R Signature Headlamp', '847706104416', '847706104416', 'Headlamps > H Series', 'Headlamps', 'H Series', 'Complete', 'H9R Signature', 'Signature Edition', 'Grey Metallic', 'Trekking adventures, camping trips, mountain climbing or boating after dark: The powerful H9R Signature headlamp is ready for any endeavor.', 'Trekking adventures, camping trips, mountain climbing or boating after dark: The powerful H9R Signature is ready for any endeavor. The headlamp combines premium design and technological innovation and guides your way in the dark: Setting up camp in the wilderness is as easy as finding a protein bar in the depths of your backpack or starting your boat’s engine at dusk. With the H9R Signature, you will witness nature’s little wonders—its light might reveal a grazing deer or the easily missed turn-off to a breathtaking hiking trail. To make sure you always have the best possible light, you can rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your H9R Signature. If you prefer manual control, the enhanced Digital Advanced Focus System is the way to go. By turning the digital focus ring, you can digitally switch from flood to spot to suit any range or task. You can also choose between red light to help you preserve your night vision, green light for wildlife observation and blue light to make liquids visible—while the optional red rear light offers additional visibility. The powerful battery also operates while charging, so you never run out of light on your adventures—and is located at the back of your head for a balanced weight distribution. To match your headlamp to your style, the H9R Signature comes with a grey metallic housing as well as a reflective headband for added visibility. When not in use, you can safely store and transport your headlamp in the enclosed pouch. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your H9R Signature contains recycled materials13.', 'Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use, up to 2400 lm (boost) as well as red, green and blue front light and optional red rear light | Intuitive focusing (Digital Advanced Focus System) via digital focus ring | Powerful battery: Charges via USB-C and operates while charging | Exclusive design: Reflective headband and grey metallic housing | Element-proof: High water and dust resistance (IP67)', 199.95, 2400, 20, 'IP67', 283, true, '21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.6V, 4600mAh, 16.56Wh)', '1 set of rechargeable batteries (21700 Li-Ion), Pouch H-series 2026, Charging cable (USB-C), Extension cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CRIxPiYvXwQ', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DSLKF2Fgg2rqwB5_27JJFSCDqSbB90dR/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,signature', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503227', 'Ledlenser H19R Signature Headlamp', '847706104423', '847706104423', 'Headlamps > H Series', 'Headlamps', 'H Series', 'Complete', 'H19R Signature', 'Signature Edition', 'Grey Metallic', 'Snowboarding, yachting, hunting or fishing after dark: With the H19R Signature headlamp, you can go further and stay out longer than ever before.', 'Snowboarding, yachting, hunting or fishing after dark: With the H19R Signature, you can go further and stay out longer than ever before. The light of your headlamp reveals miracles you might have missed otherwise, like a school of dolphins swimming near your boat at night or a majestic tree next to the ski slope. To make sure you always have the best possible light, you can rely on the innovative Adaptive Light Beam for automatic dimming and focusing and thus hands-free use of your H19R Signature. If you prefer manual control, the enhanced Digital Advanced Focus System is the way to go. By turning the digital focus ring, you can digitally switch from flood to spot to suit any range or task. You can also choose between red light to help you preserve your night vision, green light for wildlife observation and blue light to make liquids visible—while the optional red rear light offers additional visibility. The powerful battery also operates while charging, so you never run out of light on your adventures—and is located at the back of your head for a balanced weight distribution. You can use the Ledlenser Connect App for remote control and personalization. To match your headlamp to your style, the H19R Signature comes with a grey metallic housing as well as a reflective headband for added visibility. When not in use, you can safely store and transport your headlamp in the enclosed pouch. And: Our lights are made for a brighter future—therefore, your H19R Signature contains recycled materials13.', 'Automatic dimming and focusing (Adaptive Light Beam) for hands-free use, up to 4000 lm (boost) as well as red, green and blue front light and optional red rear light | Intuitive focusing (Digital Advanced Focus System) via digital focus ring | Attaches to helmet via helmet mounting set including adapter for GoPro® | Remote control and personalization via Ledlenser Connect App | Extremely powerful battery: Charges via USB-C and operates while charging', 304.95, 4000, 20, 'IP67', 387, true, '2x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery Pack (7.38V, 4800mAh, 35.42Wh)', '1 set of rechargeable batteries (2x 21700 Li-Ion), Pouch H-series 2026, Charging cable (USB-C), Extension cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_W02I-FnOs', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZqQhmscdWKenZHcGVmMxGhZCc6sfGsee/view?usp=drivesdk', 'https://swfilesystem.ledlenser.com/prod/public/media/68/34/89/1750928744/Warnings_25Languages_V5-50x38cm-20240507.pdf?ts=1768789724', 'headlamp,rechargeable head lamp,head torch,rechargeable headtorch,signature', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503097', 'Ledlenser P2R Penlight', '847706103815', '847706103815', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P2R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Ultra-compact, lightweight rechargeable penlight with 200 lumens and 90m beam range. Perfect everyday carry for quick inspections and daily tasks.', 'The Ledlenser P2R is an ultra-compact, lightweight rechargeable penlight engineered for maximum convenience and reliability. Delivering up to 200 lumens with a 90-meter beam range, it features Ledlenser''s Advanced Focus System for seamless transition between spot and flood light. Made with 75% recycled aluminum housing, it includes a pocket clip and keychain attachment for effortless everyday carry.', 'Max 200 lumens with 90m beam distance | Ultra-compact 98mm length weighing only 36g | Advanced Focus System for stepless beam focusing | Rechargeable via USB-C with included 10440 Li-Ion battery | Robust housing made with 75% recycled aluminum | IP54 water and dust resistance', 39.95, 200, 15, 'IP54', 36, true, '1x 10440 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 300mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (10440 Li-Ion), USB-C charging cable, Keychain, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wpD41bBWbNg', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wY2RfxoHBh8nxTTmDulYv7Fg3oNs_UDd/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'penlight,compact flashlight,rechargeable penlight,EDC flashlight,pocket torch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503106', 'Ledlenser P3 Keychain Flashlight', '847706103778', '847706103778', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P3', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Compact AAA-powered keychain flashlight delivering 130 lumens and 110m beam distance. Reliable everyday illumination whenever you need it.', 'The Ledlenser P3 is a handy, high-performance keychain flashlight powered by a single standard AAA alkaline battery. Weighing just 43 grams, it outputs 130 lumens and casts a beam up to 110 meters. Featuring Ledlenser''s patented Advanced Focus System and an ergonomic end-cap switch, the P3 is built from 75% recycled aluminum for everyday durability.', '130 lumens with up to 110m beam distance | Operates on 1x standard AAA alkaline battery | Patented Advanced Focus System for rapid beam transition | End-cap switch for simple, tactical operation | Durable recycled aluminum body (IP54) | Includes pocket clip and keychain attachment', 29.95, 130, 15, 'IP54', 43, false, '1x AAA Alkaline 1.5V', '1 set of AAA Alkaline batteries, Keychain, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I7083n_4VXw', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nPHwaJfKvdQ1kzPCURZpxraU67Pym5m4/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'keychain flashlight,AAA flashlight,pocket light,mini torch,everyday carry', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503107', 'Ledlenser P3R Rechargeable Keychain Flashlight', '847706103822', '847706103822', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P3R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Rechargeable keychain flashlight packing 200 lumens and 130m beam distance. USB-C charging in an ultra-compact 41g aluminum chassis.', 'The Ledlenser P3R takes compact illumination to the next level with rechargeable power. Delivering 200 lumens and a 130-meter beam range from a body measuring only 94mm, it features fast USB-C charging, the Advanced Focus System, and an end-cap switch. Built from 75% recycled aluminum with IP54 water resistance.', '200 lumens with impressive 130m beam distance | USB-C rechargeable with included 10440 Li-Ion battery | Ultra-compact 94mm length weighing 41g | Advanced Focus System for seamless spot-to-flood focusing | 75% recycled aluminum housing (IP54) | Includes pocket clip and keychain attachment', 44.95, 200, 15, 'IP54', 41, true, '1x 10440 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 300mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (10440 Li-Ion), USB-C charging cable, Keychain, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I7083n_4VXw', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Txk7H3Ssg3gomqjfR8x9H6fTNrEmmjZe/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'rechargeable keychain flashlight,EDC light,pocket torch,USB-C flashlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503098', 'Ledlenser P4 Penlight', '847706103785', '847706103785', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P4', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Classic dual-AAA penlight producing 180 lumens and 90m beam range. Perfect for mechanics, technicians, medical professionals, and inspectors.', 'The Ledlenser P4 is a professional penlight powered by two standard AAA batteries. Outputting 180 lumens with a 90m beam range, it features Ledlenser''s Advanced Focus System and an end-cap switch for precise one-handed operation. Designed for shirt or coat pockets with a sturdy clip, built from recycled aluminum.', '180 lumens with 90m beam distance | Operates on 2x standard AAA alkaline batteries | Advanced Focus System for pinpoint beam adjustment | Slim pen design (142mm length, 60g) with pocket clip | End-cap switch for fast single-handed operation | IP54 dust and splash water protection', 34.95, 180, 20, 'IP54', 60, false, '2x AAA Alkaline 1.5V', '2x AAA Alkaline batteries, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZmmTtcssV8U', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LORBbuB47cD4ROPDvdO5PElM3cRrJ7FB/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'penlight,inspection light,technician penlight,AAA flashlight,pocket light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503099', 'Ledlenser P4R Rechargeable Penlight', '847706103839', '847706103839', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P4R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'High-output rechargeable penlight delivering 300 lumens and 100m beam range. Features USB-C charging and Advanced Focus System in a sleek 57g body.', 'The Ledlenser P4R is an elite rechargeable penlight designed for demanding trade professionals and inspectors. Delivering a strong 300 lumens with a 100m beam range, it charges conveniently via USB-C and features patented Advanced Focus System optics. Crafted from 75% recycled aluminum with a robust pocket clip and IP54 rating.', 'Strong 300 lumens with 100m beam distance | USB-C rechargeable with included Li-Ion battery | Advanced Focus System for flood-to-spot beam control | Slim, lightweight pen form factor (57g) with pocket clip | End-cap switch for easy one-handed switching | Sustainable 75% recycled aluminum body (IP54)', 44.95, 300, 15, 'IP54', 57, true, '1x 10880 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 700mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (Li-Ion), USB-C charging cable, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZmmTtcssV8U', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VT5CZvBLHJtBTjaM2I90bk1UlBi0BsKy/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'rechargeable penlight,inspection torch,USB-C penlight,EDC torch,technician light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503100', 'Ledlenser P5 Compact Flashlight', '847706103792', '847706103792', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P5', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Single AA battery flashlight boasting 200 lumens and 170m beam distance. Compact, reliable all-round torch for home, workshop, and outdoors.', 'The Ledlenser P5 is a compact, robust flashlight operating on one standard AA battery. Generating 200 lumens with a beam distance of 170 meters, it incorporates the Advanced Focus System for rapid beam focusing. Featuring an end-cap switch, lanyard, and belt pouch, it is an essential everyday tool built with 75% recycled aluminum.', '200 lumens with impressive 170m beam distance | Powered by 1x standard AA alkaline battery | Patented Advanced Focus System for seamless focusing | End-cap switch for intuitive handling | 75% recycled aluminum body (IP54) | Includes belt pouch and lanyard', 49.95, 200, 20, 'IP54', 80, false, '1x AA Alkaline 1.5V', '1x AA Alkaline battery, Pouch, Lanyard', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VZqX_YnK2gg', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XdrgasPu92iBX0yt4ekA1brnWRII2N6U/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'AA flashlight,compact torch,everyday carry flashlight,outdoor light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
