  ('503101', 'Ledlenser P5R Pro Professional Rechargeable Flashlight', '847706103747', '847706103747', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P5R', 'Pro', 'Black', 'Professional edition P5R with 750 lumens, High CRI (80), dedicated charging dock, IP68 waterproof rating, and extended accessories.', 'The Ledlenser P5R Pro is built for craftspeople, technicians, and demanding trade professionals. Offering 750 lumens Boost, High CRI light (CRI 80) for natural color rendering, and complete IP68 water and dust protection. Includes a dedicated wall-mountable charging dock, USB-C cable, lanyard, and clip.', 'High CRI (80) neutral white light for accurate inspection work | 750 lumens Boost (350 lm Power) with 280m beam distance | Includes wall-mountable Charging Station for 24/7 readiness | Mode Select Ring with integrated transport lock | Maximum IP68 water and dust submersion protection | Sustainable 75% recycled aluminum construction', 99.95, 750, 15, 'IP68', 116, true, '1x 14500 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 920mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (14500 Li-Ion), Charging station, USB-C charging cable, Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VZqX_YnK2gg', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qN_ovYbMQ9pk1t5rd_Xb9PPa7VLmWK0n/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'professional flashlight,high CRI torch,charging station flashlight,IP68 torch,work light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503146', 'Ledlenser P6R Rechargeable Flashlight', '847706103846', '847706103846', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P6R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Versatile 1200 lumen flashlight with 320m beam distance, Mode Select Ring, USB-C direct charging, and IP68 waterproof rating.', 'The Ledlenser P6R is a rugged, mid-sized rechargeable flashlight engineered for versatile everyday and outdoor use. Delivering 1200 lumens Boost (700 lm Power) and a 320m beam range, it features Ledlenser''s Mode Select Ring, One-Touch Focus, and direct USB-C charging. Built from 75% recycled aluminum with IP68 submersible protection.', '1200 lumens Boost (700 lm Power) with 320m beam range | Mode Select Ring for direct access to light modes and transport lock | One-Touch Focus with Advanced Focus System | IP68 dust and water submersible protection | Direct USB-C charging with 18650 Li-Ion battery | 75% recycled aluminum construction', 109.95, 1200, 20, 'IP68', 165, true, '1x 18650 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.6V, 3000mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (18650 Li-Ion), USB-C charging cable, Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ujVwC29-Po', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1N7WDetTQ-rZzLGUQiAT85eJJZiZiEliY/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'rechargeable flashlight,1200 lumen torch,IP68 flashlight,Mode Select Ring,outdoor torch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503102', 'Ledlenser P7 Flashlight', '847706103808', '847706103808', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P7', 'Standard', 'Black', 'The legendary P7 flashlight redesigned: 650 lumens, 400m beam distance, 4x AAA batteries, and Advanced Focus System.', 'The Ledlenser P7 is one of the world''s most famous flashlights, now completely redesigned for modern performance. Powered by 4x AAA batteries, it produces 650 lumens and an extraordinary 400-meter beam range. Features an ergonomic end-cap switch, patented Advanced Focus System, belt holster, and lanyard, housed in 75% recycled aluminum.', '650 lumens with immense 400m beam throw | Operates on 4x standard AAA alkaline batteries | Patented Advanced Focus System for stepless flood-to-spot beam | Robust IP54 weather-resistant aluminum chassis | Ergonomic end-cap switch for fast operation | Includes holster and wrist lanyard', 79.95, 650, 40, 'IP54', 175, false, '4x AAA Alkaline 1.5V', '4x AAA Alkaline batteries, Pouch, Lanyard', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-9xeHzOFTC8', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Y93RmJ5WJ7wXyC4FkO4vjgqS2MaTjrkb/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'P7 flashlight,AAA torch,400m beam flashlight,long range torch,classic flashlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503111', 'Ledlenser P7R Rechargeable Flashlight', '847706103730', '847706103730', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P7R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'An icon revisited: 2000 lumen Boost, 320m beam range, Mode Select Ring, USB-C charging, and IP68 submersible protection.', 'The Ledlenser P7R is the ultimate all-round flashlight for outdoor, DIY, and professional use. Delivering up to 2000 lumens on Boost (1200 lm Power) and a 320m beam distance, it features Ledlenser''s Mode Select Ring for intuitive mode switching, transport lock, and protected USB-C port. Powered by a high-capacity 21700 Li-Ion battery (4600mAh) in a 75% recycled aluminum body.', '2000 lumens Boost (1200 lm Power) with 320m beam distance | Mode Select Ring for fast mode switching, transport lock & charging | High-capacity 21700 Li-Ion battery (4600mAh) | IP68 submersible waterproof and dustproof protection | One-Touch Focus with patented Advanced Focus System | Sustainable 75% recycled aluminum body', 129.95, 2000, 25, 'IP68', 197, true, '1x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 4600mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (21700 Li-Ion 4600mAh), USB-C charging cable, Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-9xeHzOFTC8', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SQY9MbOKgnOiGBTVQ3lmhy2XFcPLXM15/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'rechargeable flashlight,2000 lumen torch,P7R flashlight,IP68 waterproof torch,Mode Select Ring', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503103', 'Ledlenser P7R Pro Professional Rechargeable Flashlight', '847706103754', '847706103754', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P7R', 'Pro', 'Black', 'Professional P7R flashlight featuring 2000 lumens, High CRI (80), dedicated charging dock, IP68 rating, and extended industrial accessories.', 'The Ledlenser P7R Pro is engineered for industrial, trade, and inspection professionals. Outputting 2000 lumens Boost with High CRI (80) neutral light, it ensures true color recognition. Includes a dedicated wall-mountable charging station for 24/7 readiness, 21700 battery, lanyard, and clip. Fully submersible IP68 rating.', 'High CRI (80) LED for natural, accurate color recognition | 2000 lumens Boost (1200 lm Power) with 320m beam distance | Includes wall-mountable Charging Station for continuous standby | Mode Select Ring for rapid light mode switching & transport lock | IP68 submersible waterproof and dustproof protection | 75% recycled aluminum construction', 159.95, 2000, 25, 'IP68', 223, true, '1x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 4600mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (21700 Li-Ion), Charging station, USB-C charging cable, Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-9xeHzOFTC8', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1K_Z-32muVLt2bojMEZS2hF4ENY1DUDdr/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'professional flashlight,high CRI torch,P7R pro,charging dock flashlight,industrial torch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503113', 'Ledlenser P7R Signature Premium Flashlight', '4058205037372', '847706104409', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P7R', 'Signature', 'Charcoal', 'Flagship premium P7R: 2500 lumen Boost, 340m beam distance, Mode Select Ring, red auxiliary light, charging dock, and premium leather/nylon pouch.', 'The Ledlenser P7R Signature is the ultimate expression of premium illumination. Boasting an incredible 2500 lumens Boost (1400 lm Power) and a 340-meter beam range, it features an elegant hard-anodized charcoal housing, red auxiliary light, Mode Select Ring, and One-Touch Focus. Includes dedicated charging station, USB-C cable, premium pouch, and lanyard.', 'Maximum 2500 lumens Boost (1400 lm Power) with 340m beam distance | Mode Select Ring with integrated red auxiliary light and transport lock | Premium hard-anodized charcoal finish with iconic red ring | Includes wall-mountable Charging Station & premium storage pouch | Submersible IP68 waterproof and dustproof rating | Made with 75% recycled aluminum', 199.95, 2500, 25, 'IP68', 197, true, '1x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 4600mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (21700 Li-Ion), Charging station, USB-C charging cable, Premium Pouch, Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z42cAaDDgRo', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SQY9MbOKgnOiGBTVQ3lmhy2XFcPLXM15/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'premium flashlight,P7R signature,2500 lumen torch,luxury flashlight,IP68 flashlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503112', 'Ledlenser P18R High-Power Searchlight', '847706103853', '847706103853', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P18R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Massive 6500 lumen searchlight throwing light 600 meters. Features Mode Select Ring, USB-C direct charging, and IP68 submersible protection.', 'The Ledlenser P18R is a high-power handheld searchlight built for outdoor expeditions, security patrols, and search and rescue. Outputting 6500 lumens Boost (3200 lm Power) with a 600-meter beam range, it features Ledlenser''s Mode Select Ring, One-Touch Focus, and direct USB-C charging. Housed in 75% recycled aluminum with full IP68 water submersion rating.', 'Massive 6500 lumens Boost (3200 lm Power) with 600m beam distance | Mode Select Ring for rapid light mode switching & transport lock | High-capacity 3x 18650 Li-Ion battery pack | IP68 dustproof and submersible waterproof protection | Patented Advanced Focus System with One-Touch Focus | Durable 75% recycled aluminum housing', 299.95, 6500, 50, 'IP68', 651, true, '3x 18650 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery Pack (11.1V, 3000mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery pack (3x 18650 Li-Ion), USB-C charging cable, Wrist lanyard', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qgsSg4YcmS0', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ha2XeFClZPH5UqacDqmd_XM-3ekHIgLb/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'searchlight,high power flashlight,6500 lumen torch,P18R searchlight,rescue flashlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503114', 'Ledlenser P18R Signature High-End Searchlight', '4058205037358', '847706104423', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P18R', 'Signature', 'Charcoal', 'High-end flagship searchlight with 7000 lumens, 630m beam range, Mode Select Ring, heavy-duty protective hard case, and IP68 rating.', 'The Ledlenser P18R Signature is the crown jewel of high-output handheld illumination. Boasting an astounding 7000 lumens Boost (3500 lm Power) and a 630-meter beam range, it features an elegant hard-anodized charcoal finish, Mode Select Ring, and One-Touch Focus. Ships in a rugged, custom protective hard case with battery pack, USB-C cable, and lanyard.', 'Enormous 7000 lumens Boost (3500 lm Power) with 630m beam reach | Mode Select Ring for instant access to lighting modes & transport lock | High-end hard-anodized charcoal housing with red design accents | Includes heavy-duty protective hard case for secure transport | Submersible IP68 waterproof and dustproof protection | Sustainable 75% recycled aluminum construction', 399.95, 7000, 50, 'IP68', 651, true, '3x 18650 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery Pack (11.1V, 3000mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery pack (3x 18650 Li-Ion), Heavy-duty protective hard case, USB-C charging cable, Wrist lanyard', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I63bfjYvuEw', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ha2XeFClZPH5UqacDqmd_XM-3ekHIgLb/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', '7000 lumen searchlight,flagship flashlight,P18R signature,hard case flashlight,extreme searchlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503105', 'Ledlenser P21R Ultimate Searchlight', '847706103860', '847706103860', 'Flashlights > P Series', 'Flashlights', 'P Series', 'Complete', 'P21R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'The ultimate searchlight: 12,000 lumens, 1100m beam distance (over 1 km), One-Touch Focus, wall-mount charging station, and hard case.', 'The Ledlenser P21R is the ultimate handheld searchlight and the most powerful flashlight Ledlenser has ever built. Pumping out an astounding 12,000 lumens Boost (5000 lm Power) with a beam reaching over 1100 meters, it features One-Touch Focus, Mode Select Ring, and high-capacity LiFePO4 battery technology. Includes heavy-duty hard case, wall-mountable charging dock, shoulder strap, tripod adapter, and rubber bumpers.', 'Colossal 12,000 lumens Boost (5000 lm Power) with 1100m beam range | Ultra-safe high-cycle LiFePO4 battery pack (3x 21700) | One-Touch Focus and Mode Select Ring for thumb-operated control | Includes charging station, hard case, shoulder strap, tripod mount & bumpers | IP68 submersible waterproof and dustproof protection | Built from 75% recycled heavy-duty aluminum', 499.95, 12000, 220, 'IP68', 1250, true, '3x 21700 LiFePO4 Rechargeable Battery Pack (9.6V, 4000mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery pack (3x 21700 LiFePO4), Wall-mountable charging station, USB-C charging cable, Heavy-duty hard case, Shoulder strap, Tripod adapter, Protective rubber bumpers', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-6pmgbhO0vw', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gYQGBBD3cR2AH0A115CyHaqhRBji0IOL/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', '12000 lumen searchlight,ultimate searchlight,1km beam flashlight,P21R searchlight,rescue spotlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503187', 'Ledlenser TT3R Tactical Flashlight', '4058205038935', '847706103893', 'Tactical Flashlights > TAC Series', 'Tactical Flashlights', 'TAC Series', 'Complete', 'TT3R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Robust tactical flashlight engineered for police, special forces, and emergency services: 1900 lumens, red/blue tactical LEDs, and Mode Select Ring.', 'The Ledlenser TT3R is engineered for police, special forces, security personnel, and emergency services around the world. Delivering up to 1900 lumens with a combined flood and spotlight pattern (300m range), it features additional red and blue LEDs for night vision and signaling. Equipped with a 2-step tactical end-cap switch, Mode Select Ring with transport lock, and hard-anodized aluminum housing rated IP68.', 'Tactical beam pattern combining flood and spot with 1900 lumens (300m range) | Auxiliary Red and Blue LEDs for signaling and night vision | 2-step tactical End Cap Switch and Mode Select Ring with transport lock | High-capacity 21700 Li-Ion battery rechargeable via USB-C | Hard-anodized aircraft aluminum housing with diamond knurling | Submersible IP68 waterproof and dustproof protection', 179.95, 1900, 25, 'IP68', 218, true, '1x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 4600mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (21700 Li-Ion 4600mAh), Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o4VjzQ7cjRA', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/10IwAyyyacS8CGqiuYi2Qfcu5O96ujbqs/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'tactical flashlight,police flashlight,TT3R,red blue LED torch,tactical torch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503052', 'Ledlenser TAC6R Tactical Flashlight', '4058205035965', '847706103596', 'Tactical Flashlights > TAC Series', 'Tactical Flashlights', 'TAC Series', 'Complete', 'TAC6R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Ultra-compact tactical flashlight with 2000 lumens, Multi-Lens Technology, 370m beam distance, and tactical end-cap switch.', 'The Ledlenser TAC6R is an extremely compact tactical flashlight designed for law enforcement, military, and private security operators. Delivering up to 2000 lumens (34,000 cd) and a 370-meter beam range, it features Ledlenser''s revolutionary Multi-Lens Technology allowing instant switching between multi-mission tactical beams, flood, and spot. Features tactical end-cap switch, mechanical transport lock, and IP68 submersible housing.', 'Multi-mission tactical beam: combined flood/spot plus dedicated flood and spot beams | Up to 2000 lumens (34,000 cd) with 370m tactical beam distance | Tactical End Cap Switch with direct access to Strobe and Check modes | Mechanical transport lock prevents accidental discharge | Compact, rugged hard-anodized aluminum body (158g, IP68) | USB-C rechargeable with included 18650 Li-Ion battery (2600mAh)', 149.95, 2000, 20, 'IP68', 158, true, '1x 18650 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.6V, 2600mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (18650 Li-Ion), USB-C charging cable, Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0wySZw4nVwE', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vYdzj-qsVCfLKJLyqQM8bqRYSVINz9b6/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'tactical flashlight,TAC6R,compact tactical torch,multi-lens flashlight,military torch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503294', 'Ledlenser TAC6R Tactical Outdoor Set', '4058205042154', '847706104215', 'Tactical Flashlights > TAC Series', 'Tactical Flashlights', 'TAC Series', 'Complete', 'TAC6R', 'Outdoor Set', 'Black', 'Complete tactical weapon & outdoor kit: TAC6R flashlight, Case Type B, Remote Switch Type H, Picatinny Mount, Universal Mount, and Color Filters.', 'The Ledlenser TAC6R Outdoor Set provides a comprehensive, field-ready mission package. Includes the TAC6R tactical flashlight (2000 lumens, 370m range), rugged Case Type B, Remote Switch Type H for silent weapon operation, Picatinny Rail Mount Type A, Universal Mount 0362, and a 4-color filter set (Red, Green, Blue, Yellow).', 'Complete field tactical kit in rugged Case Type B | TAC6R flashlight with 2000 lumens and Multi-Lens Technology | Includes Remote Switch Type H for silent weapon activation | Includes Picatinny Rail Mount Type A and Universal Mount 0362 | Includes 4-color filter set 35.1mm (Red/Green/Blue/Yellow) | Maximum IP68 submersible water and dust protection', 189.95, 2000, 20, 'IP68', 158, true, '1x 18650 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.6V, 2600mAh)', 'TAC6R Flashlight, Case Type B, Remote Switch Type H, Picatinny Mount A, Universal Mount 0362, Color Filter Set 35.1mm, 18650 Battery, USB-C Cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0wySZw4nVwE', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bQhMQbN02nBFvRw7eD3VTFTAwAbRWBKY/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'tactical kit,TAC6R outdoor set,weapon mount light,remote switch torch,hunting flashlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503053', 'Ledlenser TAC7R Tactical Flashlight', '4058205035996', '847706103599', 'Tactical Flashlights > TAC Series', 'Tactical Flashlights', 'TAC Series', 'Complete', 'TAC7R', 'Standard', 'Black', 'Heavy-duty tactical flashlight with 3200 lumens, RGB auxiliary light, Multi-Lens Technology, Mode Select Ring, and 21700 battery.', 'The Ledlenser TAC7R is the flagship heavy-duty tactical flashlight engineered for police, SWAT, security forces, and demanding missions. Boasting 3200 lumens (34,000 cd) and 370m beam distance, it features Multi-Lens Technology, full RGB auxiliary LEDs, a 4-position Mode Select Ring (Flash, RGB, Mission, Lock), and a 2-stage tactical end-cap switch. Housed in diamond-knurled hard-anodized aluminum with IP68 submersible protection.', 'Multi-mission tactical beam: combined flood/spot, dedicated flood, and high-intensity spot | Massive 3200 lumens (34,000 cd) with 370m beam reach | Mode Select Ring for seamless switching between Flash, RGB, Mission & Lock | Auxiliary RGB LEDs for signaling, tracking, and night vision preservation | 21700 Li-Ion battery (4600mAh) rechargeable via protected USB-C | Heavy-duty hard-anodized aluminum with diamond knurling (IP68)', 189.95, 3200, 25, 'IP68', 220, true, '1x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 4600mAh)', 'Rechargeable battery (21700 Li-Ion 4600mAh), USB-C charging cable, Lanyard, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PHN6JT1T2Yc', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wjXXf9fgC9qXUdOJRA8nO57ZOHQyV1Kg/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'tactical flashlight,TAC7R,3200 lumen torch,RGB tactical light,police searchlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503295', 'Ledlenser TAC7R Tactical Outdoor Set', '4058205042185', '847706104218', 'Tactical Flashlights > TAC Series', 'Tactical Flashlights', 'TAC Series', 'Complete', 'TAC7R', 'Outdoor Set', 'Black', 'Complete heavy tactical weapon & outdoor kit: TAC7R flashlight, Case Type B, Remote Switch Type I, Picatinny Mount, Universal Mount, and Color Filters.', 'The Ledlenser TAC7R Outdoor Set is the definitive heavy tactical mission kit for special forces and hunters. Includes the flagship TAC7R flashlight (3200 lumens, RGB, Mode Select Ring), rugged Case Type B, Remote Switch Type I for silent weapon operation, Picatinny Rail Mount Type A, Universal Mount 0362, and 4-color filter set (Red, Green, Blue, Yellow).', 'Comprehensive mission kit housed in rugged Case Type B | TAC7R flashlight with 3200 lumens, RGB LEDs, and Multi-Lens Optics | Includes Remote Switch Type I for silent weapon operation | Includes Picatinny Rail Mount Type A and Universal Mount 0362 | Includes 4-color filter set 35.1mm | Submersible IP68 waterproof and dustproof protection', 239.95, 3200, 25, 'IP68', 220, true, '1x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Battery (3.7V, 4600mAh)', 'TAC7R Flashlight, Case Type B, Remote Switch Type I, Picatinny Mount A, Universal Mount 0362, Color Filter Set 35.1mm, 21700 Battery, USB-C Cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PHN6JT1T2Yc', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JVHH1ZOUjdGnQYkxrZLt5SZ_I8ScnHib/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'tactical set,TAC7R outdoor set,weapon mount flashlight,remote switch kit,hunting torch', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502053', 'Ledlenser ML4 Outdoor Lantern (White Light)', '4058205017886', '847706100807', 'Lanterns > ML Series', 'Lanterns', 'ML Series', 'Complete', 'ML4', 'Standard White', 'White/Black', 'Ultra-compact outdoor camping lantern with 300 lumens, glare-free Micro Prism Technology, Dual Power, and red light mode.', 'The Ledlenser ML4 is an ultra-compact, lightweight outdoor lantern that delivers up to 300 lumens of warm, glare-free illumination. Equipped with patented Micro Prism Technology, it distributes light evenly and efficiently. Powered by an included 14500 rechargeable Li-ion battery or standard AA alkaline batteries (Dual Power). Features carabiner snap hook for versatile hanging, magnetic charging, and red light mode to preserve night vision.', 'Ultra-compact design (97mm, 71g) | 300 lumens with patented Micro Prism Technology for glare-free 360° light | Dual Power: operates on included 14500 Li-ion battery or standard AA battery | Red light function to preserve night vision | Carabiner snap-hook closure for flexible attachment | IP66 dustproof and heavy rain protection | Magnetic Charge System', 49.95, 300, 5, 'IP66', 71, true, '1x 14500 Li-ion Battery 3.7V (750mAh) or 1x AA Alkaline 1.5V', '1x 14500 Li-ion rechargeable battery, Magnetic charging cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5N_V7JhibkU', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'camping lantern,mini lantern,rechargeable lantern,ML4,outdoor light,carabiner lantern', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502231', 'Ledlenser ML4 Warm Light Outdoor Lantern', '4058205022125', '847706100807', 'Lanterns > ML Series', 'Lanterns', 'ML Series', 'Complete', 'ML4 Warm Light', 'Warm Light', 'White/Black', 'Ultra-compact camping lantern with cozy warm white light (300 lumens), glare-free Micro Prism Technology, and Dual Power.', 'The Ledlenser ML4 Warm Light creates a cozy, comfortable outdoor atmosphere with pleasant warm white illumination (2700-3000K) and up to 300 lumens. Features patented Micro Prism optical microstructure for glare-free 360-degree light distribution. Dual Power technology allows operation with either the included rechargeable 14500 battery or standard AA alkalines. Includes carabiner hook, magnetic charging cable, and red light mode.', 'Warm white light (2700-3000K) for a cozy camping ambiance | Up to 300 lumens with glare-free Micro Prism Technology | Dual Power: operates on rechargeable 14500 Li-ion or standard AA battery | Additional red light mode to preserve night vision | Integrated carabiner snap hook for versatile hanging | Magnetic Charge System and IP66 weather resistance', 49.95, 300, 5, 'IP66', 71, true, '1x 14500 Li-ion Battery 3.7V (750mAh) or 1x AA Alkaline 1.5V', '1x 14500 Li-ion rechargeable battery, Magnetic charging cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LSLwi-XBy_A', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'warm light lantern,camping lantern,rechargeable lantern,ML4 warm,tent lantern,portable light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('500929', 'Ledlenser ML6 Outdoor Lantern', '4058205011259', '847706100593', 'Lanterns > ML Series', 'Lanterns', 'ML Series', 'Complete', 'ML6', 'Standard White', 'White/Black', 'High-power 750 lumen camping lantern with glare-free Micro Prism Technology, powerbank USB output, magnet, and hook.', 'The Ledlenser ML6 is a powerful, glare-free camping lantern delivering up to 750 lumens. Micro Prism Technology provides highly efficient, even 360-degree light distribution. Equipped with an integrated powerbank function (USB-A port) to recharge mobile devices, magnetic base for mounting to metal surfaces, rubber hook, and removable stand. Steplessly dimmable with red light mode and IP66 water resistance.', 'High output: 750 lumens Boost (550 lm Power) with Micro Prism Technology | Built-in Powerbank function with USB-A output to charge smartphones | Stepless dimming and red reading light mode | Versatile mounting: magnetic base, rubber hook, and removable base with metal flip hook | Glow-in-the-dark buttons and elements for easy nighttime locating | IP66 dustproof and heavy splash protection', 89.95, 750, 5, 'IP66', 280, true, '1x 18650 Li-ion Battery 3.6V (3000mAh)', '1x 18650 rechargeable battery, Stand, Transport pouch, USB charging cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UxUv_CmL9ZU', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'camping lantern,powerbank lantern,750 lumen lantern,ML6,rechargeable lantern,emergency light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
