  ('502201', 'Ledlenser ML6 Connect WL Smart Outdoor Lantern', '4058205021203', '847706102120', 'Lanterns > ML Series', 'Lanterns', 'ML Series', 'Complete', 'ML6 Connect WL', 'Connect WL', 'White/Black', 'Smart app-controlled 750 lumen lantern with Bluetooth connectivity, Magnetic Charge, powerbank, and customizable light modes.', 'The Ledlenser ML6 Connect WL is the smart flagship outdoor lantern with Bluetooth connectivity. Wirelessly personalize and control brightness, light modes, and timers via the Ledlenser Connect App or included wireless remote. Delivering 750 lumens with glare-free Micro Prism Technology, warm white light, red light, powerbank USB output, and convenient Magnetic Charge System.', 'Smart Bluetooth app control & wireless remote control | 750 lumens with patented glare-free Micro Prism Technology | Built-in Powerbank function with USB-A port for mobile devices | Magnetic Charge System for fast, reliable charging | Stepless dimming, custom light profiles, and red night-vision light | Magnetic base, rubber hanging hook, and removable stand', 119.95, 750, 5, 'IP66', 260, true, '1x 18650 Li-ion Battery 3.6V (3000mAh)', '1x 18650 rechargeable battery, Wireless remote control, Stand, Transport pouch, Magnetic charging cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UxUv_CmL9ZU', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'smart lantern,bluetooth lantern,ML6 connect,app controlled light,powerbank lantern,camping light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
