  ('502537', 'Ledlenser Kidled2 Children Headlamp (Green)', '4058205027038', '847706102627', 'Kids Lights > Kid Series', 'Kids Lights', 'Kid Series', 'Complete', 'Kidled2', 'Green Dino', 'Green', 'Childrens headlamp & clip light with 40 lumens, sensitive glare reduction, white/red/blue light, and breakaway safety headband.', 'The Ledlenser Kidled2 Green is designed specifically for children with safety at its core. Emitting 40 lumens with glare-reduced optics, it includes White, Red, and Blue light modes with flashing functions. Features an automatic 20-minute shut-off, child-proof lockable battery cover, removable metal clip for attaching to backpacks/clothing, and a breakaway safety headband.', 'White (40 lm), Red, and Blue light with flashing function | Optics designed to minimize glare for young eyes | Automatic 20-minute shut-off timer to save battery | Breakaway headband opens automatically under tension for safety | Removable metal clip for mounting to clothing or schoolbags | IP44 rating and child-safe lockable battery compartment', 19.95, 40, 5, 'IP44', 35, false, '1x AAA Alkaline 1.5V', '1x AAA Alkaline battery, Safety headband, Metal clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j5S-0pgYwGs', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'kids headlamp,children headtorch,Kidled2,clip light kids,safe headlamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
