  ('880553', 'Ledlenser Flex3 Powerbank (1x 18650)', '4058205018029', '847706100692', 'Powerbanks > Flex Series', 'Powerbanks', 'Flex Series', 'Complete', 'Flex3', 'Standard', 'Black/Green', '6-in-1 outdoor powerbank and battery charger for 18650 batteries with IP65 water/dust resistance.', 'The Ledlenser Flex3 is an innovative 6-in-1 outdoor powerbank and charger powered by 1x 18650 Li-ion battery. Functions as a powerbank to charge mobile devices, battery charger, safe battery storage, short-circuit protection, battery level indicator, and water/dust resistant IP65 housing. The rechargeable battery can be easily swapped in seconds.', '6-in-1 system: Powerbank, Battery Charger, Secure Storage, Charge Indicator, Double Short-Circuit Protection, IP65 Casing | Replaceable 18650 Li-ion battery | Rugged IP65 water and dust resistant housing | Easy USB charging | Eco-friendly concept: replace battery, not the powerbank', 49.95, NULL, NULL, 'IP65', 88, true, '1x 18650 Li-ion Battery 3.6V (3400mAh)', '1x 18650 Li-ion rechargeable battery, USB cable', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2TXwH9CQqyk', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'powerbank,18650 charger,Flex3,portable battery,rugged powerbank,IP65 powerbank', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502511', 'Ledlenser Flex5 Powerbank (1x 21700)', '4058205026697', '847706102795', 'Powerbanks > Flex Series', 'Powerbanks', 'Flex Series', 'Complete', 'Flex5', 'Standard', 'Black/Green', '6-in-1 outdoor powerbank with replaceable 21700 battery (4500mAh), IP65 waterproof rating, and USB-C port.', 'The Ledlenser Flex5 is a versatile 6-in-1 outdoor powerbank offering 4500mAh capacity powered by an included, replaceable 21700 Li-ion battery. Functions as a powerbank, battery charger, secure storage case, battery status indicator, double short-circuit protection, and water/dust resistant IP65 housing. Features locking wheel mechanism and USB-C charging.', '6-in-1 concept: Powerbank with replaceable battery, IP65 water/dust protection, battery charger, safe battery storage, short-circuit protection, charge indicator | Capacity: 16.65 Wh / 4500 mAh (1x 21700 Li-ion battery) | Fast charging via USB-C port | Robust housing with locking wheel | Weight: 126g with battery', 59.95, NULL, NULL, 'IP65', 126, true, '1x 21700 Li-ion Battery 3.7V (4500mAh)', '1x 21700 Li-ion rechargeable battery, USB Cable (USB-A to USB-C)', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2TXwH9CQqyk', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'powerbank,21700 charger,Flex5,waterproof powerbank,replaceable battery powerbank,outdoor charger', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502127', 'Ledlenser Flex10 Powerbank (2x 21700)', '4058205019286', '847706102672', 'Powerbanks > Flex Series', 'Powerbanks', 'Flex Series', 'Complete', 'Flex10', 'Standard', 'Black/Green', 'High-capacity 9000mAh dual 21700 powerbank, battery charger, and IP65 rugged battery case with separate level indicators.', 'The Ledlenser Flex10 is a heavy-duty 6-in-1 outdoor powerbank equipped with two replaceable 21700 Li-ion batteries providing 9000mAh (33.3 Wh) of energy. Features dual independent battery charge level indicators (25%, 50%, 75%, 100%), IP65 water and dust protection, locking wheel, dual short-circuit protection, and fast USB-A to USB-C charging.', 'Heavy-duty 9000 mAh capacity (33.30 Wh) from 2x replaceable 21700 Li-ion batteries | 6-in-1 system: dual powerbank, independent dual battery charger, protective storage, IP65 housing | Separate LED charge indicators for each battery | Locking wheel for secure retention during travel | IP65 water and dust resistant housing', 119.95, NULL, NULL, 'IP65', 235, true, '2x 21700 Li-ion Battery 3.7V (9000mAh total)', '2x 21700 Li-ion rechargeable batteries, USB Cable (USB-A to USB-C)', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=daC67uXRU0w', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'powerbank,dual 21700 charger,Flex10,9000mAh powerbank,IP65 powerbank,rugged powerbank', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502921', 'Ledlenser AF2R Work Area Floodlight', '4058205033381', '847706103525', 'Area Lights > AF Series', 'Area Lights', 'AF Series', 'Complete', 'AF2R Work', 'Work', 'Black/Yellow', 'Compact 1000 lumen rechargeable floodlight with red light mode, magnet, velcro strap, and IP54 housing.', 'The Ledlenser AF2R Work is an ultra-portable area floodlight producing up to 1000 lumens across 5 brightness levels. Equipped with auxiliary red light (steady and flashing), integrated magnetic base, and flexible velcro strap for mounting to pipes, scaffolding, and tripods. Housed in a tough IP54 casing with USB-C rechargeable internal battery.', '1000 lumens across 5 brightness levels | Auxiliary red light with 2 brightness levels and flash mode | High CRI (≥ 80) for natural color rendering | Flexible mounting: powerful magnet, velcro strap, fold-out stand | Compact pocket-sized format (332g) | USB-C rechargeable with battery indicator', 99.95, 1000, 50, 'IP54', 332, true, 'Li-ion Battery 3.7V (4800mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, Storage pouch, Velcro tape', 'https://www.youtube.com/shorts/lpV-qujoSyc', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'area light,work floodlight,AF2R,rechargeable worklight,magnetic floodlight,compact floodlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502910', 'Ledlenser AF4R Work Area Floodlight', '4058205033053', '847706103464', 'Area Lights > AF Series', 'Area Lights', 'AF Series', 'Complete', 'AF4R Work', 'Work', 'Black/Yellow', '2000 lumen compact Hybrid Power floodlight with Multi-Concentrated Light, Tunable White, IP67 waterproof rating, and diffuser.', 'The Ledlenser AF4R Work is a compact, high-performance area floodlight delivering up to 2000 lumens. Features revolutionary Multi-Concentrated Light technology that directs light with higher efficiency and reduced peripheral glare. Offers 5 brightness levels and 5-stage Tunable White (3000K-6500K). Hybrid Power design operates on internal rechargeable battery or mains power (50W supply included). Tough IP67 aluminum housing with removable diffuser.', '2000 lumens with Multi-Concentrated Light technology for targeted, glare-free light | Tunable White: 5 color temperatures (3000K - 6500K) with CRI ≥ 80 | Hybrid Power: operates via internal rechargeable battery or continuous AC mains (50W power supply included) | Submersible IP67 water and dust resistance with robust aluminum housing | Detachable diffuser for soft, homogeneous lighting | Fold-out stand, magnetic base, and tripod hole', 199.95, 2000, 200, 'IP67', 1370, true, 'Li-ion Battery (33.8 Wh / 4700 mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, 50W Power supply with cable, Detachable diffuser', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4ua83yYRDE', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'area light,construction floodlight,AF4R,tunable white light,hybrid floodlight,IP67 floodlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502911', 'Ledlenser AF8R Work Area Floodlight', '4058205033084', '847706103471', 'Area Lights > AF Series', 'Area Lights', 'AF Series', 'Complete', 'AF8R Work', 'Work', 'Black/Yellow', 'Powerful 4000 lumen mid-size floodlight with Multi-Concentrated Light, Tunable White, Bluetooth-ready, and Hybrid Power.', 'The Ledlenser AF8R Work is a powerful mid-size work floodlight delivering up to 4000 lumens. Features Multi-Concentrated Light optics with 35% higher light concentration and up to 12% energy savings. Offers 5 brightness levels, 5-stage Tunable White (3000K-6500K), Hybrid Power (battery and mains), and Bluetooth readiness for optional wireless controller. Built in IP67 aluminum chassis with detachable diffuser.', '4000 lumens with Multi-Concentrated Light technology | Tunable White: 5 color temperatures (3000K - 6500K, CRI ≥ 80) | Hybrid Power: internal 50.8 Wh battery or AC mains operation (50W supply included) | Bluetooth-ready for optional wireless Area Light Controller (503018) | IP67 waterproof and dustproof aluminum housing with shock protection | Fold-out stand, tripod mounting hole, and magnet', 299.95, 4000, 500, 'IP67', 1870, true, 'Li-ion Battery (50.8 Wh / 4700 mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, 50W Power supply with cable, Detachable diffuser', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fB4lubtpm5Q', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'area floodlight,AF8R,construction light,4000 lumen floodlight,tunable white light,bluetooth floodlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502917', 'Ledlenser AL10R Work 360° Area Light Lantern', '4058205033268', '847706103518', 'Area Lights > AL Series', 'Area Lights', 'Area Lights', 'Complete', 'AL10R Work', 'Work', 'Black/Yellow', 'Massive 6300 lumen 360° area light lantern with 3 individually switchable panels (120°/240°/360°), Tunable White, and IP67 rating.', 'The Ledlenser AL10R Work is an extraordinary 360-degree site lighting lantern generating up to 6300 lumens across 72 LEDs. Features 3 individually switchable light panels allowing 120°, 240°, or 360° illumination to direct light and prevent waste. Provides 5 brightness levels, 5-stage Tunable White (3000K-6500K), Hybrid Power (battery & mains), silicone hanging hook, tripod mount, and chemical-resistant IP67 construction.', 'Colossal 6300 lumens with 72 LEDs and 5 brightness levels | 3 individually switchable light panels: choose 120°, 240°, or full 360° illumination | Tunable White: 5 color temperatures (3000K to 6500K, CRI ≥ 80) | Hybrid Power: powerful 50.76 Wh battery plus continuous mains operation | Submersible IP67 protection and chemical resistant body | Flexible mounting: silicone hanging hook and tripod screw thread', 299.95, 6300, 750, 'IP67', 1397, true, 'Li-ion Battery 3.7V (50.76 Wh / 4700 mAh, internal)', 'Power supply, Diffuser, Hard case', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=02IkPEqkooY', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', '360 area light,site light lantern,AL10R,6300 lumen lantern,work light 360,construction lantern', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502916', 'Ledlenser AT10C Work Corded Area Floodlight', '4058205033237', '847706103323', 'Area Lights > AT Series', 'Area Lights', 'Area Lights', 'Complete', 'AT10C Work', 'Work', 'Black/Yellow', 'Continuous mains-operated 5000 lumen work floodlight with Multi-Concentrated Light, Tunable White, and IP67 rating.', 'The Ledlenser AT10C Work is a dedicated corded AC mains area light engineered for continuous site illumination. Delivering up to 5000 lumens across 5 brightness levels and 5-stage Tunable White (3000K-6500K, CRI ≥ 80). Multi-Concentrated Light technology prevents glare and maximizes light efficiency. Rated IP67 with rugged aluminum chassis, 50W power supply, and detachable diffuser.', 'Continuous mains operation: 5000 lumens across 5 brightness levels | Multi-Concentrated Light technology with Reduced Peripheral Glare | Tunable White: 5-stage color temperature adjustment (3000K - 6500K) | Rugged aluminum housing with IP67 dust and immersion protection | Detachable diffuser and velcro tape included', 249.95, 5000, 500, 'IP67', 1365, false, 'Mains operation only (50W supply included)', 'Power supply with 50W cable, Diffuser, Velcro tape, Hard case', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=02IkPEqkooY', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'corded floodlight,mains worklight,AT10C,5000 lumen floodlight,site floodlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
