  ('503269', 'Ledlenser W1R Work Clip Light', '4058205041546', '847706103235', 'Worklights > W Series', 'Worklights', 'W Series', 'Complete', 'W1R Work', 'Work', 'Black', 'Ultra-compact clip light with 220 lumens, white and red light, swivelling lamp head, magnet, and USB-C charging.', 'The Ledlenser W1R Work is an ultra-compact, versatile clip light delivering 220 lumens of homogeneous work light. Features white and red light modes, a swivelling joint and 360-degree rotating lamp head, integrated magnet for hands-free positioning, and a sturdy clip for attaching to work clothing or caps. USB-C rechargeable with an IP54 rating.', 'Ultra-compact clip light (61g) with 220 lumens | White and red light modes | Flexible illumination via swivel joint and rotating lamp head | Integrated magnet for flexible positioning on metal surfaces | Easy USB-C charging with battery indicator | IP54 water and dust resistant', 29.95, 220, 60, 'IP54', 61, true, 'Li-ion Battery 3.7V (740mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, Integrated clip & magnet', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhhcTQbrISk', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'clip light,worklight,W1R work,compact worklight,magnetic clip light,red light clip', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502808', 'Ledlenser W2 Work Pen & Test Light', '4058205032032', '847706103228', 'Worklights > W Series', 'Worklights', 'W Series', 'Complete', 'W2 Work', 'Work', 'Black', 'Compact AAA pen and test light with 160 lumen flood light and 80 lumen spot light for tradespeople and mechanics.', 'The Ledlenser W2 Work is a handy pen-sized test light for electricians, tradespeople, and mechanics. Features two independent light sources: an efficient 160-lumen COB flood light for wide-area work, and an 80-lumen spot LED in the lamp head for inspecting tight spaces. Powered by 2x standard AAA batteries with a sturdy pocket clip and corrugated surface for non-slip grip.', 'Dual light sources: 160 lumen COB floodlight + 80 lumen precision spot LED | Slim pen format (176mm, 65g) with sturdy pocket clip | Powered by 2x standard AAA alkaline batteries | Corrugated non-slip surface for secure grip with oily hands | IP54 dust and splash water protection', 24.95, 160, 40, 'IP54', 65, false, '2x AAA Alkaline 1.5V', '2x AAA Alkaline batteries, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhhcTQbrISk', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'inspection light,pen light,W2 work,mechanic test light,AAA worklight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
