  ('502733', 'Ledlenser W4R Work Inspection Light', '4058205030441', '847706103198', 'Worklights > W Series', 'Worklights', 'W Series', 'Complete', 'W4R Work', 'Work', 'Black', 'Compact and powerful inspection light with 220 lumen flood, 100 lumen spot, magnet, and 360° swivel base.', 'The Ledlenser W4R Work is a compact, robust inspection light delivering 220 lumens of wide flood light and a focused 100 lumen spot light. Features a flexible 360-degree swivel base with integrated magnet and pocket clip for versatile hands-free positioning in engine bays and narrow workspaces. USB-C rechargeable with battery indicator and IP54 rating.', 'Dual light sources: 220 lm flood + 100 lm spot light | 360-degree swivel base with powerful integrated magnet | Sturdy pocket clip and transport lock | USB-C rechargeable with battery status indicator | Compact and lightweight (91g) with IP54 rating', 47.95, 220, 60, 'IP54', 91, true, 'Li-ion Battery 3.7V (760mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, Swivel base with magnet, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhhcTQbrISk', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'inspection light,swivel worklight,W4R work,magnetic worklight,workshop lamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502735', 'Ledlenser W5R Work Powerful Work Light', '4058205030502', '847706103204', 'Worklights > W Series', 'Worklights', 'W Series', 'Complete', 'W5R Work', 'Work', 'Black', 'Powerful 600 lumen work light with High CRI (80), 220 lumen spot LED, magnet, swivel base, and USB-C port.', 'The Ledlenser W5R Work is a powerful, professional work light generating 600 lumens of wide-area floodlight with superior color rendering (CRI 80). Features an additional 220-lumen spot LED in the head, flexible magnetic swivel base, clip, and hook for hands-free illumination. USB-C rechargeable with battery status indicator and robust IP54 housing.', '600 lumens wide floodlight with High CRI (80) for accurate color rendering | Powerful 220 lumen spot LED for long-range inspection | Flexible swivel base with integrated magnet and clip | USB-C rechargeable with high-capacity 2500mAh Li-ion battery | Battery and charge level indicator | IP54 water and dust resistant', 59.95, 600, 220, 'IP54', 153, true, 'Li-ion Battery 3.7V (2500mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, Swivel base with magnet, Pocket clip', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhhcTQbrISk', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'worklight,high CRI worklight,W5R work,600 lumen worklight,magnetic workshop lamp', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502736', 'Ledlenser W6R Work Foldable Work Light', '4058205030533', '847706103242', 'Worklights > W Series', 'Worklights', 'W Series', 'Complete', 'W6R Work', 'Work', 'Black', 'Foldable and rotatable work light with 500 lumens, 180° fold-out / 270° rotating head, spot LED, and strong magnet.', 'The Ledlenser W6R Work is an ultra-flexible professional work light featuring a lamp head that folds out 180 degrees and swivels 270 degrees. Delivers 500 lumens of premium flood light (CRI 80) and a 120-lumen spot LED for illuminating the most inaccessible spaces. Equipped with magnetic base, fold-out hook, battery indicator, and fast USB-C charging.', '180° foldable and 270° rotatable lamp head for maximum versatility | 500 lumen floodlight (High CRI 80) + 120 lumen spot LED | Powerful magnet in the base and fold-out hook for hands-free work | High-capacity 2500mAh Li-ion battery rechargeable via USB-C | Battery and charge level indicator | IP54 rating', 69.95, 500, 220, 'IP54', 180, true, 'Li-ion Battery 3.7V (2500mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, Integrated magnet & fold-out hook', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OgbJEUvWNa4', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'foldable worklight,rotatable lamp,W6R work,slim inspection light,mechanic light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('502737', 'Ledlenser W7R Work Light with UV & Tunable White', '4058205030564', '847706103259', 'Worklights > W Series', 'Worklights', 'W Series', 'Complete', 'W7R Work', 'Work', 'Black', 'Ultimate 600 lumen work light with UV leak detection light (365nm), continuously adjustable color temperature (4000-7500K), and 180°/270° head.', 'The Ledlenser W7R Work is the ultimate work light for trade professionals, HVAC technicians, and automotive specialists. Delivering 600 lumens of flood light with continuously adjustable color temperature (4000K-7500K, CRI 80) and integrated 365nm UV light for leak detection and document inspection. The lamp head folds 180 degrees and rotates 270 degrees. Features magnet, hook, and USB-C charging.', 'Integrated UV LED (365 nm) for leak detection, fluorescence and document verification | Continuously adjustable color temperature (4000K - 7500K) with High CRI (80) | 180° foldable and 270° rotatable lamp head | 600 lumens floodlight with stepless dimming | Strong magnetic base and metal hanging hook | High-capacity 2500mAh Li-ion battery rechargeable via USB-C (IP54)', 89.95, 600, 220, 'IP54', 180, true, 'Li-ion Battery 3.7V (2500mAh, internal)', 'USB-C charging cable, Integrated magnet & fold-out hook', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y1XIl3hNwLs', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xpbOCNcoi8-9___OOnCyAqaj4BGc1lmt/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'UV worklight,leak detection light,W7R work,tunable white worklight,HVAC light,mechanic light', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503265', 'Ledlenser P7R 25th Anniversary Edition Flashlight', '4058205041393', '4058205041393', 'Flashlights > 25th Anniversary', 'Flashlights', '25th Anniversary', 'Complete', 'P7R', '25th Anniversary Edition', 'Dark Blue', 'Special 25th Anniversary Edition P7R flashlight in limited Dark Blue with 2000 lumens, Mode Select Ring, 25-year warranty, and value pack with 2 batteries.', 'To celebrate 25 years of pioneering brilliance, Ledlenser reimagined one of its most iconic models: the P7R. Featuring a limited Dark Blue colorway, an exclusive 25-year warranty, and a value pack including two 21700 Li-Ion rechargeable batteries (4600mAh each) for double the runtime. Delivering 2000 lumens Boost (1200 lm Power) and a 320m beam distance with Mode Select Ring, USB-C direct charging, and IP68 submersible protection.', 'Limited 25th Anniversary Edition in exclusive Dark Blue finish | Value pack: includes two rechargeable 21700 Li-ion batteries (4600mAh each) | Exclusive 25-year warranty celebrating 25 years of Ledlenser | 2000 lumens Boost (1200 lm Power) with 320m beam range | Mode Select Ring for intuitive mode switching, transport lock & charging | IP68 submersible waterproof and dustproof protection', 139.95, 2000, 25, 'IP68', 197, true, '2x 21700 Li-Ion Rechargeable Batteries (3.6V, 4600mAh each)', '2 sets of batteries (21700 Li-Ion), Charging cable (USB-C), Adjustable hand strap / lanyard, Box', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-9xeHzOFTC8', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1APaA8nPzVni-Xod4ocgqApEDu1yLsj4a/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'P7R anniversary,25th anniversary,dark blue flashlight,2000 lumen torch,25 year warranty,limited edition flashlight', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503266', 'Ledlenser T2 25th Anniversary Edition Flashlight', '4058205041423', '4058205041423', 'Flashlights > 25th Anniversary', 'Flashlights', '25th Anniversary', 'Complete', 'T2', '25th Anniversary Edition', 'Dark Blue', 'Beloved tactical EDC flashlight reimagined for 25th Anniversary in limited Dark Blue, 240 lumens, end cap switch, and exclusive 25-year warranty.', 'Small but mighty: the Ledlenser T² is one of the most beloved and well-known tactical EDC flashlights in Ledlenser history. Rooted in tradition since the first Photon Pump V8, the reimagined 25th Anniversary T² features a limited Dark Blue colorway, non-slip textured aluminum housing, and an exclusive 25-year warranty. Outputting 240 lumens with a 180m beam range from 3x AAA batteries with IP56 weather resistance.', 'Limited 25th Anniversary Edition in exclusive Dark Blue finish | Exclusive 25-year warranty celebrating 25 years of Ledlenser excellence | 240 lumens with 180m beam distance | Tactical End-Cap Switch for fast single-handed operation | Operates on 3x standard AAA alkaline batteries | Rugged non-slip aluminum chassis (IP56) weighing only 98g', 59.95, 240, 25, 'IP56', 98, false, '3x AAA Alkaline 1.5V', '1 set of batteries (3x AAA Alkaline), Hand strap / lanyard, Box', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wTkALrzN2Qg', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/10hC0M60jEWBhbbvjGmx5BZRai05UlLZv/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'T2 anniversary,T2 flashlight,25th anniversary,tactical EDC torch,AAA flashlight,limited edition', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
  ('503264', 'Ledlenser H8R 25th Anniversary Edition Headlamp', '4058205041362', '4058205041362', 'Headlamps > 25th Anniversary', 'Headlamps', '25th Anniversary', 'Complete', 'H8R', '25th Anniversary Edition', 'Dark Blue', 'Iconic 600 lumen headlamp updated with USB-C charging, limited Dark Blue colorway, red rear light, 25-year warranty, and 2 batteries.', 'To celebrate 25 years of portable light excellence, Ledlenser updated its iconic H8R headlamp with a direct USB-C charging port on the battery box, limited Dark Blue design accents, and an exclusive 25-year warranty. Delivered as a value pack with two 18650 USB-C rechargeable batteries (2600mAh each) for double the runtime. Delivers up to 600 lumens with Advanced Focus System, Rapid Focus, and red rear light.', 'Limited 25th Anniversary Edition with Dark Blue accents & Dark Stone graphic | Value pack: includes two rechargeable 18650 Li-ion batteries for double runtime | Updated battery box featuring direct USB-C charging | Exclusive 25-year warranty | 600 lumens with 150m beam range and Advanced Focus System | Integrated red rear safety light for 360° visibility', 109.95, 600, 10, 'IP54', 158, true, '2x 18650 Li-Ion Rechargeable Batteries (3.6V, 2600mAh each)', '2 sets of batteries (18650 Direct USB-C), USB-C charging cable, Washable detachable headband, Box', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wTkALrzN2Qg', 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1d6uVICAIi29rwNrAd-JOT2JWYhojqNTN/view?usp=drive_link', 'https://www.ledlenser.com/manuals', 'H8R anniversary,25th anniversary headlamp,rechargeable headlamp,USB-C headlamp,25 year warranty,limited edition', 'Ledlenser Product Data Import File V1.0 11-2.xlsx'),
